            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An optical system (10) includes a first lens (L1), a second lens (L2), a third lens (L3), a fourth lens (L4), a fifth lens (L5), a sixth lens (L6). Each of the first, third, and fifth lenses (L1, L3, L5) has positive refractive power, each of the second, fourth, and sixth lenses (L2, L4, L6) has negative refractive power. Object side surfaces (S1, S3, S5, S9) of the first, second, third, and fifth lenses (L1, L2, L3, L5) and an imaging side surface (S6) of the third lens (L3) are convex near the optical axis (101), imaging side surfaces (S2, S4, S8, S10, S12) of the first, second, fourth, fifth, and sixth lenses (L1, L2, L4, L5, L6) are concave near the optical axis (101). The optical system (10) satisfies: 1.9&amp;lt;FNO&amp;lt;3.5, and 19°&amp;lt;FOV&amp;lt;33°.</p>
            </abstract>
